{"name":"Baby Motive","hex":"#8fcbdc","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"baby","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A very young human, particularly from birth to a couple of years old or until walking is fully mastered.","Any very young animal, especially a vertebrate; many species have specific names for their babies, such as kittens for the babies of cats, puppies for the babies of dogs, and chicks for the babies of birds. See Category:Baby animals for more."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Picked when small and immature (as in baby corn, baby potatoes).","Newest (overall, or in some group or state); most inexperienced."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/baby"},{"term":"motive","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An idea or communication that makes one want to act, especially from spiritual sources; a divine prompting. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","An incentive to act in a particular way; a reason or emotion that makes one want to do something; anything that prompts a choice of action."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To prompt or incite by a motive or motives; to move."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/motive"}],"entries":[],"images":[],"sounds":{"baby":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/En-us-baby.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/de/En-us-baby.ogg/En-us-baby.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/En-a_baby.oga?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/En-a_baby.oga/En-a_baby.oga.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/En-uk-bab